{"id":"1e614d50ee9b59d5","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SetUC.md","title":"SetUC","display":"SetUC","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SetUC","parameters":["a","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SetUC"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>a</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SetUC a b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists E\n  (exists F (exists R (exists f (exists r (and (@ SetSig E F R f r) (@ FClosure E F R f r a b)))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a8b1332dd97b2603\" href=\"?note=a8b1332dd97b2603\" title=\"ZFC_FClosure\">FClosure</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b769d4b8d11e5120\" href=\"?note=b769d4b8d11e5120\" title=\"ZFC_SetSig\">SetSig</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ SetUC a b)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FClosure","status":"resolved","id":"a8b1332dd97b2603","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FClosure|FClosure]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SetSig","status":"resolved","id":"b769d4b8d11e5120","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FClosure|FClosure]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":829,"backlinks":[{"id":"ed8ec2c6db773694","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SetUC|SetUC]]"},{"id":"95a04cea88e6598c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_SetCodeExtensionality|SetCodeExtensionality]]；[[ZFC_SetComprehensionRaw|SetComprehensionRaw]]；[[ZFC_SetUC|SetUC]]"},{"id":"c5808eb83ace05d1","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_SetCodeEmpty|SetCodeEmpty]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeExtensionality|SetCodeExtensionality]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeInfinity|SetCodeInfinity]]；[[ZFC_SetCodePairing|SetCodePairing]]；[[ZFC_SetCodePower|SetCodePower]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeRegularity|SetCodeRegularity]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeUnion|SetCodeUnion]]；[[ZFC_SetReplacementRaw|SetReplacementRaw]]；[[ZFC_SetSeparationRaw|SetSeparationRaw]]；[[ZFC_SetUC|SetUC]]"},{"id":"ca544ad9f0aa8f47","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_SetCodeChoice|SetCodeChoice]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeEmpty|SetCodeEmpty]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeExtensionality|SetCodeExtensionality]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeInfinity|SetCodeInfinity]]；[[ZFC_SetCodePairing|SetCodePairing]]；[[ZFC_SetCodePower|SetCodePower]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeRegularity|SetCodeRegularity]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeUnion|SetCodeUnion]]；[[ZFC_SetReplacementRaw|SetReplacementRaw]]；[[ZFC_SetSe